{"id":"42db21ac702cc072","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-thm-skolem-hull-construction.md","title":"Skolem Hull Construction","display":"thm-skolem-hull-construction — Skolem Hull Construction","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-skolem-hull-construction","aliases":["58-thm-skolem-hull-construction","Skolem Hull","Skolemization"],"display":"thm-skolem-hull-construction — Skolem Hull Construction","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-substructure.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-skolem-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-skolem-hull-construction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-skolem-hull-construction</span><span>Skolem Hull</span><span>Skolemization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-skolem-hull-construction — Skolem Hull Construction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md\">../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"563f382027630287\" href=\"?note=563f382027630287\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-substructure.md\">../batch13/58-df-substructure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e7eb620808ce373c\" href=\"?note=e7eb620808ce373c\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-skolem-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-skolem-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L,M,N,A,H,\\mathcal S,F,\\bar a\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L,M,N,A,H,\\mathcal S,F,\\bar a\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S,\\mathrm{Substructure}_S,\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S,\\mathrm{Substructure}_S,\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\prec_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> are the typed notions from dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_{M}(F,\\varphi,x,\\bar y,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_{M}(F,\\varphi,x,\\bar y,n)\\)</span> is the exact six-place Skolem-function predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> is the free-variable operator</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SkolemFamily}_S,\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SkolemFamily}_S,\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S\\)</span> (auxiliary predicates defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SkolemFamily}_S(\\mathcal S,M,\\mathcal L)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\bar y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^n\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar y)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\to\\exists F\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle\\varphi,x,\\bar y,n,F\\rangle\\in\\mathcal S\n\\land\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_{M}(F,\\varphi,x,\\bar y,n)\\bigr)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S(H,A,\\mathcal S,M)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nH=\n\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{\nB\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M):\nA\\subseteq B\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}\\land\n\\forall\\langle\\varphi,x,\\bar y,n,F\\rangle\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in B^n\\;\n(F(\\bar a)\\in B)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SkolemFamily}_S(\\mathcal S,M,\\mathcal L)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\bar y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^n\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar y)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\to\\exists F\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle\\varphi,x,\\bar y,n,F\\rangle\\in\\mathcal S\n\\land\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_{M}(F,\\varphi,x,\\bar y,n)\\bigr)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S(H,A,\\mathcal S,M)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nH=\n\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{\nB\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M):\nA\\subseteq B\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}\\land\n\\forall\\langle\\varphi,x,\\bar y,n,F\\rangle\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in B^n\\;\n(F(\\bar a)\\in B)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull\\text{-}construction} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\n\\land\\mathrm{SkolemFamily}_S(\\mathcal S,M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land|\\mathcal S|\\leq\\max(|\\mathcal L|,\\aleph_0)\n\\to\n\\exists H\\;\\exists N\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S(H,A,\\mathcal S,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(N,M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(N)=H\n\\land N\\prec_{\\mathcal L} M\n\\land|H|\\leq\\max(|A|,|\\mathcal L|,\\aleph_0)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull\\text{-}construction} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\n\\land\\mathrm{SkolemFamily}_S(\\mathcal S,M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land|\\mathcal S|\\leq\\max(|\\mathcal L|,\\aleph_0)\n\\to\n\\exists H\\;\\exists N\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S(H,A,\\mathcal S,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(N,M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(N)=H\n\\land N\\prec_{\\mathcal L} M\n\\land|H|\\leq\\max(|A|,|\\mathcal L|,\\aleph_0)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Skolem hull: key construction in model theory.</li>\n<li>Skolem functions witness existential formulas and generate the hull. Each family entry now records the formula, displayed variables, arity, and function required by the exact upstream six-place predicate.</li>\n<li>Elementarity is the language-indexed relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\prec_{\\mathcal L}M\">\\(N\\prec_{\\mathcal L}M\\)</span>, not an unbound two-place glyph.</li>\n<li>The hull size satisfies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathrm{Hull}(A)| \\le |A| + |\\mathrm{Language}| + \\omega\">\\(|\\mathrm{Hull}(A)| \\le |A| + |\\mathrm{Language}| + \\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>A hull of the empty set is prime only under additional hypotheses on the theory and the chosen Skolem expansion.</li>\n<li>Tarski-Vaught: test for elementarity.</li>\n<li>Löwenheim-Skolem: derived from hull construction.</li>\n<li>Applications: constructing small models, proving existence.</li>\n<li>Condensation lemma in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>: uses Skolem hull argument.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md","status":"resolved","id":"faf104362ffe13b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-substructure.md","status":"resolved","id":"563f382027630287","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-substructure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-skolem-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7eb620808ce373c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-skolem-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L,M,N,A,H,\\mathcal S,F,\\bar a\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S,\\mathrm{Substructure}_S,\\mathrm{Univ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_{M}(F,\\varphi,x,\\bar y,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SkolemFamily}_S,\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SkolemFamily}_S(\\mathcal S,M,\\mathcal L)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\bar y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^n\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar y)\\\\\n&\\hspace{28mm}\\to\\exists F\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle\\varphi,x,\\bar y,n,F\\rangle\\in\\mathcal S\n\\land\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_{M}(F,\\varphi,x,\\bar y,n)\\bigr)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S(H,A,\\mathcal S,M)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\nH=\n\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{\nB\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M):\nA\\subseteq B\\\\\n&\\hspace{17mm}\\land\n\\forall\\langle\\varphi,x,\\bar y,n,F\\rangle\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in B^n\\;\n(F(\\bar a)\\in B)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull\\text{-}construction} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\n\\land\\mathrm{SkolemFamily}_S(\\mathcal S,M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land|\\mathcal S|\\leq\\max(|\\mathcal L|,\\aleph_0)\n\\to\n\\exists H\\;\\exists N\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{SkolemHull}_S(H,A,\\mathcal S,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(N,M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(N)=H\n\\land N\\prec_{\\mathcal L} M\n\\land|H|\\leq\\max(|A|,|\\mathcal L|,\\aleph_0)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"N\\prec_{\\mathcal L}M","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathrm{Hull}(A)| \\le |A| + |\\mathrm{Language}| + \\omega","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":3041,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4422","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-thm-skolem-hull-construction.md|58-thm-skolem-hull-construction]]（batch04）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-259","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-thm-0-sharp.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-condensation.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-definability.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-generic-extension.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-is-transitive.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-ZFC.md]]\n[[58-thm-MM.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equal-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equals-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-absoluteness-calculation.md]]\n[[58-thm-ac-wellorder-equivalent.md]]\n[[58-thm-aleph-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-completeness.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-set-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category-theory.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category.md]]\n[[58-thm-banach-tarski.md]]\n[[58-thm-beth-function-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-boolean-valued-model.